Third-party software
--------------------

The app in app/ links NISDK3, the Neo smartpen SDK for iOS and macOS:

    https://github.com/NeoSmartpen/iOS-SDK3.0
    Copyright 2017 NeoLAB Convergence, Inc.
    License: GNU General Public License, version 3

NISDK3 is not in this repository. The Swift package manager downloads it
when the app is built.

A built copy of the app contains NISDK3. For that reason a built copy of
the app, as a whole, is distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3. The source code in this repository stays under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, and can be used under that license without NISDK3.

The app also links Sparkle, the software update framework:

    https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle
    Copyright 2006-2013 Andy Matuschak, and the Sparkle Project contributors
    License: MIT

Sparkle is not in this repository either. A built copy of the app contains
it, with its license text.

